OL,3,GNEWSAHealth minister defends hospital
OL,4,Adeal decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's health minister has said he
OL,7,Fwas right to sign a multimillion-pound
OL,8,Fcontract to build a new hospital before
OL,9,Fwork to review the deal was finished.
OL,11,FSenator Tom Binet agreed the deal with
OL,12,Fconstruction firm Bouygues UK for the
OL,13,F#710m project days before June's
OL,14,Fgeneral election.
OL,16,FThat was despite the concerns of senior
OL,17,Fcivil servants and the treasury
OL,18,Fminister that more due diligence was
OL,19,Fneeded.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
